# Gariachin (ElrokiTeleporter) sends a character back whether it holds an attack stance or not
# (onTalk): only Orahochin's refusal asks isInCombat. Not traced: the reference probe's hits put
# nobody in a stance.
character Islander 40
script script.teleport.ElrokiTeleporter
page default/32112.htm
page script/teleport/ElrokiTeleporter/
npc gariachin 32112 Folk 10 0 0

action gariachin
action gariachin
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=gariachin item=0 page=default/32112.htm
  S ActionFailed
stance player on
  stance player on
bypass npc_{gariachin}_Quest ElrokiTeleporter
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S TeleportToLocation obj=player loc=7557,-5513,-3221 fast=0
  S DeleteObject obj=gariachin
  S ActionFailed
